# Global AI Agent Workforce Integration 2026 - MCA Project

**Objective:** Analyze impact of AI agents on productivity, ROI, security & sentiment.

**Dataset:** 2500 companies, 13 features
- Industries: Education, Finance, Retail, Healthcare, Manufacturing, Logistics
- Roles: HR, Legal, Sales, Data Analytics, Supply Chain, Software Eng, Customer Support

**Modules:**
1. EDA - avg productivity, governance impact
2. Visualization - Plotly 4 charts
3. ML - RandomForest to predict Months_To_Positive_ROI & Productivity_Gain
4. Dashboard - Flask + Bootstrap

**How to Run:**
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
-> http://127.0.0.1:5000

**Key Findings:**
- Strict Governance = 60% less security incidents
- Customer Support agents give highest productivity (60%)
- Medium companies (51-500) get ROI in 3-7 months

**Viva Ready:** DFD, ER, Architecture included in report.